  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "Let the roots of \\(x^2-3x+1=0\\) be \\(r\\) and \\(s.\\) Then the expression \\(r^2+s^2\\) is:",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "a positive integer"
    },
    {
      "label": "B",
      "text": "a positive fraction greater than \\(1\\)"
    },
